OL,3,GOPINIONCPSB cuts are inevitable and    
OL,4,Cpoliticians need to move beyond        
OL,5,Ccondemnation                           
OL,7,FPlanned cuts to ITV's bespoke output   
OL,8,Ffor Wales and Northern Ireland are a   
OL,9,Ffurther blow to viewers.               
OL,11,FThe cuts emerged last week. They       
OL,12,Finclude the end of what are,           
OL,13,Fpresumably, some of the more expensive 
OL,14,Flocal programmes including Coast and   
OL,15,FCountry in Wales and the long form     
OL,16,Fdocumentary series Up Close on UTV.    
OL,18,FThe cuts should be no surprise. ITV's  
OL,19,Fadvertising revenue continues to       
OL,20,Fdecline. #30m of "temporary" cuts were 
OL,21,Frecently announced too.                
OL,23,EPub: 15-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,150,140,200,120,0,100
