OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 149 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCPSB cuts are inevitable and    
OL,4,Cpoliticians need to move beyond        
OL,5,Ccondemnation                           
OL,7,FNobody can blame a commercial          
OL,8,Fbroadcaster for axing programmes which 
OL,9,Fdon't make money, however regrettable. 
OL,11,FThere are no plans for cuts to the news
OL,12,Fservice to the best of our knowledge.  
OL,14,FBut these cuts ` which don't need      
OL,15,Fapproval from Ofcom ` do contribute to 
OL,16,Fa wider sense of crisis in public      
OL,17,Fservice broadcasting.                  
OL,19,FThey come just weeks after significant 
OL,20,Fcuts were announced at BBC Wales, BBC  
OL,21,FNI and BBC Scotland.                   
OL,23,EPub: 15-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,150,140,200,120,0,100
