OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 149 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCPSB cuts are inevitable and    
OL,4,Cpoliticians need to move beyond        
OL,5,Ccondemnation                           
OL,7,FEnglish regional programmes ` outside  
OL,8,Fnews and politics ` have already all   
OL,9,Fbut disappeared.                       
OL,11,FThe collective impact of these cuts by 
OL,12,Fthe BBC and ITV should be a matter for 
OL,13,Fpublic concern.                        
OL,15,FHowever the BBC and ITV should not be  
OL,16,Fin the firing line. The BBC is facing a
OL,17,Ffunding crisis which is not of its     
OL,18,Fmaking. This should be addressed       
OL,19,Furgently by Westminster.               
OL,23,EPub: 15-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,150,140,200,120,0,100
