OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 149 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCPSB cuts are inevitable and    
OL,4,Cpoliticians need to move beyond        
OL,5,Ccondemnation                           
OL,7,FITV is dealing with what appears to be 
OL,8,Fa continuing, fundamental shift in the 
OL,9,Fadvertising market ` not a bit of      
OL,10,Fmarket turbulence.                     
OL,12,FIf you believe that ITV should carry   
OL,13,Fpublic service obligations, there must 
OL,14,Fbe a real debate over how they should  
OL,15,Fbe financed to make them sustainable.  
OL,17,FI have argued before that the          
OL,18,Frestrictions on the volume of          
OL,19,Fadvertising on C3, C4 and C5 may be    
OL,20,Fmaking matters worse.                  
OL,23,EPub: 15-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,150,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14905
SC,0005
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 149 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCPSB cuts are inevitable and    
OL,4,Cpoliticians need to move beyond        
OL,5,Ccondemnation                           
OL,7,FAlternatively, does Ofcom need tougher 
OL,8,Fpowers?                                
OL,10,FITV's licences compel a minimum amount 
OL,11,Fof bespoke content for Wales and       
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland ` UTV has to show 2   
OL,13,Fhours a week of local content outside  
OL,14,Fnews with 45 minutes in peak.          
OL,16,FOfcom has tight regulations concerning 
OL,17,Fstandards.                             
OL,19,FBut ` providing the quota is met and   
OL,20,Findividual programmes meet the rules ` 
OL,21,Fit can do little more.                 
OL,23,EPub: 15-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,150,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14906
SC,0006
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 149 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCPSB cuts are inevitable and    
OL,4,Cpoliticians need to move beyond        
OL,5,Ccondemnation                           
OL,7,FEndless studio chat and discussions    
OL,8,Fcould meet the quota.                  
OL,10,FNow of course a "cheap" programme need 
OL,11,Fnot be a "bad" one. There is nothing   
OL,12,Fwrong with a meaningful studio         
OL,13,Finterview. What matters is the overall 
OL,14,Frange and ambition of the output.      
OL,16,FIf regional output is to consist of    
OL,17,Fnothing more than cheap material to    
OL,18,Fmeet quotas, then now long will it be  
OL,19,Fbefore Ofcom is asked to consider      
OL,20,Fchanges to the legal minimum volume of 
OL,21,Foutput.                                
OL,23,EPub: 15-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,150,140,200,120,0,100
