OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 149 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCPSB cuts are inevitable and    
OL,4,Cpoliticians need to move beyond        
OL,5,Ccondemnation                           
OL,7,FIt is too easy for politicians to      
OL,8,Fsimply condemn cuts.                   
OL,10,FThey must rise to the challenge and    
OL,11,Fexplore why cuts are being made and try
OL,12,Fto properly support public service     
OL,13,Fbroadcasting.                          
OL,23,EPub: 15-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
